WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A successful HTTP response does
not establish a correct payment.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.120
The retry must refer
to the original transfer.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.760
There must be one journal
with balanced entries,

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.600
and the payer and recipient balances
must match the approved contract.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.200
Obtain the original identity
from independent service evidence.

00:00:17.376 --> 00:00:21.520
Then challenge the same assertions
against a correct build and a deliberately

00:00:21.568 --> 00:00:24.960
defective one. Passing
the first and failing the second

00:00:25.028 --> 00:00:28.080
demonstrates useful fault
detection for this scenario.
